{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15977","headline":"春燕词 · 王建","name":"春燕词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新燕新燕何不定，东家绿池西家井。\n飞鸣当户影悠扬，一遶檐头一遶梁。\n黄姑说向新妇女，去年堕子污衣箱。\n已能辞山复过海，幸我堂前故巢在。\n求食慎勿爱高飞，空中饥鸢爲尔害。\n辛勤作窠在画梁，愿得年年主人富。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}